e:10b (1)

=== clean profile: styleq | and before one ((1) 2 is 1 applied to 2, 1 2 a vector)
c:(1) 2

=== QS004 profile: styleq | after a name nothing changes without them
r:a (3)

=== clean profile: styleq | parentheses that group more than one token
r:(a+b)*c

=== clean profile: styleq | a call is not a parenthesised operand
r:g(1;2)

