=== clean profile: styleq | a typed or pattern parameter is the name it binds (q 5: {[a:`j;b] a+b}[1;2] is 3)
/ Adds.
/ @param a a long
/ @param b a long
add:{[a:`j;b] a+b}
/ Sums a pair.
/ @param p one
/ @param q the other
sum2:{[(p;q)] p+q}

=== clean profile: styleq | the block documents a projection, which takes more than the lambda inside it
apply:{[idx;n;function] function idx n}
// @param pc Validation share
// @param n Repetitions
// @param function Applied to each split
split:apply{[pc;n] n#pc}

